{"post": true, "caption": "Going all in on one coin feels like conviction. Really, it lets one decision control your whole account.\nSplit the same $1,000 across 5 coins, and one coin crashing 80% costs you $160, not $800.\nSpreading out won't stop losses, and coins often fall together. So keep each position small too.\nHave you ever gone all in on one coin? Yes or no.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TradingForBeginners #BeginnerMistake #RiskManagement #CryptoBasics", "tag": "BEGINNER MISTAKE", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 100, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 140, "lines": [{"t": "ALL IN.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "ONE COIN.", "c": "fg"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.8, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Feels brave.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Watch what one", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "bad coin does.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 80, "lines": [{"t": "You have $1,000.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "One coin drops 80%.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 6.0, "title": "One coin drops 80%", "subtitle": "$1,000 total, simple example", "rows": [{"l": "All in one coin", "v": 800, "vl": "-$800", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}, {"l": "Split across 5", "v": 160, "vl": "-$160", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 3.0, "label": "Split across 5, you still have", "value": "$840", "note": "All in? Just $200 left.", "c": "green"}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Spreading out", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "won't stop losses.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.2, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "It stops one coin", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "from ending you.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}